        <mxCell id="qWLn5vZDrTnf9ysT2-j--59" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="Initialize ManagedChannel&lt;div&gt;(manages complete lifecycle of a TCP connection of the client and server, supporting connection retries, graceful shutdown and initilizaion)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Channel needs IP address of the server we wanna connect to, get it from server map nitialized in above step&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(199, 125, 187); font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 10.5pt; background-color: rgb(25, 26, 28);&quot;&gt;channel=new ManagedChannel(&lt;/span&gt;serverAddess,port)&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
